@lesson A1.02 "Introductions & Basics"

# ===== PART A =====

# --- Question words & pronouns (Quizlet 2A cards 10-23) ---
@word Wat? = What?
@word Wien? = Who?
@word Wou? = Where?
@word Wéi? = How?
@word ech = I
@word du = you (informal & singular)
@word hien = he
@word hatt = she
@word si = she (respectful)
@word et = it
@word mir = we
@word dir = you (informal & plural)
@word Dir = you (formal, singular or plural)
@word si = they

# --- Adverbs / short phrases (Quizlet 2A cards 29-30, 32-33, 35, 37, 45, 62) ---
@word schonn = already
@word esou vill = so much
@word ech hoffen = I hope
@word nëmmen = only
@word vun haut un = from today
@word lëtzebuergesch Buschtawen = Luxembourgish letters
@word liicht = easy, light
@word riicht = straight

# --- Verbs (Quizlet 2A cards 63) ---
@word duschen = to shower

# --- Nouns with multiple forms (Quizlet 2A cards 34, 38-44, 46-57, 59-60, 64-69) ---
@word eng Saach, d'Saach (f), Saachen (pl) = thing, things
