@word en Duuscht, den Duuscht (m, non-countable) = thirst
@word e Virnumm, de Virnumm (m), Virnimm = first name, first names
@word en Nonumm, den Nonumm (m), Nonimm = last name, last names
@word e Familljennumm, de Familljennumm (m), Familljennimm = surname, surnames
@word e grousse P, P majuscule = uppercase P
@word e klenge p, p minuscule = lowercase p

# ===== PART B =====

# --- Phrases / vocabulary (Quizlet 2B cards 4, 10) ---
@word anert Wuert = different word
